UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52694067595814
DESCRIPTION:Arts @ Shields returns with student chamber singers led by Nic
 olás Dosman\, director of choirs. Free and open to all\, the program incl
 udes:\n\n \n\nAlbert McNeil: Hold Out Your LightGyörgy Orbán: Daemon irr
 epit callidusMark Butler: Signs of the Judgement\n Arts @ Shields is desig
 ned to showcase the performing arts — by students\, for students — in 
 the heart of campus. This event is presented in partnership with the Depar
 tment of Music.
LOCATION:Shields Library\, Lobby
URL:https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/arts-shields-pop-up-performan
 ce-chamber-singers
