DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T153000
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52694264140200
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special preview of Relative Motion\, the Departm
 ent of Theatre and Dance's 2026 Spring Dance Concert which showcases new w
 orks by student choreographers! Enjoy select segments from the student wor
 ks and brief discussions by the choreographers about their creative proces
 s. \n\nRelative Motion opens May 14 in the Main Theatre.\n \n\n\n\n\nArts 
 @ Shields is designed to showcase the performing arts — by students\, fo
 r students — in the heart of campus. This event is presented in partners
 hip with the Department of Theatre and Dance.
LOCATION:Shields Library\, Lobby Mezzanine
URL:https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/arts-shields-pop-up-performan
 ce-relative-motion
